Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Teleport to a kit drop point after picking a kit

/kp adddrop saves a drop point for the current world, /kp deldrops removes
them. With Arena.TeleportOnKit (default true) a player who picks a kit is sent
to a random drop point a tick later; worlds without drop points behave as
before. Arena spawns stay the lobby (entry, death, /kp spawn).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
